    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not a \"small change\" that fixes this. it's everything. it's the whole life i'm living. i look at the situation and there is literally no way to win. i feel like i'm just waiting for it to end. it almost feels like maybe it's okay that i feel this way... like maybe wanting everything to just just stop is the only logical reaction to this much pain. wouldn't you agree that sometimes there isn't a better way than just letting go?",
